ss='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:15.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "kp6:16.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:16.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:16.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:16.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "kp6:17.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:17.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:17.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:17.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "kp6:18.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:18.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:18.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "kp6:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "kp6:19.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"kp6:0.1": "Khuddakapāṭha 6 ", "kp6:0.2": "Ratanasutta ", "kp6:1.1": "Yānīdha bhūtāni samāgatāni, ", "kp6:1.2": "Bhummāni vā yāni va antalikkhe; ", "kp6:1.3": "Sabbeva bhūtā sumanā bhavantu, ", "kp6:1.4": "Athopi sakkacca suṇantu bhāsitaṁ. ", "kp6:2.1": "Tasmā hi bhūtā nisāmetha sabbe, ", "kp6:2.2": "Mettaṁ karotha mānusiyā pajāya; ", "kp6:2.3": "Divā ca ratto ca haranti ye baliṁ, ", "kp6:2.4": "Tasmā hi ne rakkhatha appamattā. ", "kp6:3.1": "Yaṁ kiñci vittaṁ idha vā huraṁ vā, ", "kp6:3.2": "Saggesu vā yaṁ ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ; ", "kp6:3.3": "Na no samaṁ atthi tathāgatena, ", "kp6:3.4": "Idampi buddhe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ; ", "kp6:3.5": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:4.1": "Khayaṁ virāgaṁ amataṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:4.2": "Yadajjhagā sakyamunī samāhito; ", "kp6:4.3": "Na tena dhammena samatthi kiñci, ", "kp6:4.4": "Idampi dhamme ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ; ", "kp6:4.5": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:5.1": "Yaṁ buddhaseṭṭho parivaṇṇayī suciṁ, ", "kp6:5.2": "Samādhimānantarikaññamāhu; ", "kp6:5.3": "Samādhinā tena samo na vijjati, ", "kp6:5.4": "Idampi dhamme ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ; ", "kp6:5.5": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:6.1": "Ye puggalā aṭṭha sataṁ pasatthā, ", "kp6:6.2": "Cattāri etāni yugāni honti; ", "kp6:6.3": "Te dakkhiṇeyyā sugatassa sāvakā, ", "kp6:6.4": "Etesu dinnāni mahapphalāni; ", "kp6:6.5": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:6.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:7.1": "Ye suppayuttā manasā daḷhena, ", "kp6:7.2": "Nikkāmino gotamasāsanamhi; ", "kp6:7.3": "Te pattipattā amataṁ vigayha, ", "kp6:7.4": "Laddhā mudhā nibbutiṁ bhuñjamānā; ", "kp6:7.5": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:7.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:8.1": "Yathindakhīlo pathavissito siyā, ", "kp6:8.2": "Catubbhi vātehi asampakampiyo; ", "kp6:8.3": "Tathūpamaṁ sappurisaṁ vadāmi, ", "kp6:8.4": "Yo ariyasaccāni avecca passati; ", "kp6:8.5": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:8.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:9.1": "Ye ariyasaccāni vibhāvayanti, ", "kp6:9.2": "Gambhīrapaññena sudesitāni; ", "kp6:9.3": "Kiñcāpi te honti bhusaṁ pamattā, ", "kp6:9.4": "Na te bhavaṁ aṭṭhamamādiyanti; ", "kp6:9.5": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:9.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:10.1": "Sahāvassa dassanasampadāya, ", "kp6:10.2": "Tayassu dhammā jahitā bhavanti; ", "kp6:10.3": "Sakkāyadiṭṭhī vicikicchitañca, ", "kp6:10.4": "Sīlabbataṁ vāpi yadatthi kiñci. ", "kp6:11.1": "Catūhapāyehi ca vippamutto, ", "kp6:11.2": "Chaccābhiṭhānāni abhabba kātuṁ; ", "kp6:11.3": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:11.4": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:12.1": "Kiñcāpi so kamma karoti pāpakaṁ, ", "kp6:12.2": "Kāyena vācā uda cetasā vā; ", "kp6:12.3": "Abhabba so tassa paṭicchadāya, ", "kp6:12.4": "Abhabbatā diṭṭhapadassa vuttā; ", "kp6:12.5": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:12.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:13.1": "Vanappagumbe yatha phussitagge, ", "kp6:13.2": "Gimhānamāse paṭhamasmiṁ gimhe; ", "kp6:13.3": "Tathūpamaṁ dhammavaraṁ adesayi, ", "kp6:13.4": "Nibbānagāmiṁ paramaṁ hitāya; ", "kp6:13.5": "Idampi buddhe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:13.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:14.1": "Varo varaññū varado varāharo, ", "kp6:14.2": "Anuttaro dhammavaraṁ adesayi; ", "kp6:14.3": "Idampi buddhe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:14.4": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:15.1": "Khīṇaṁ purāṇaṁ nava natthi sambhavaṁ, ", "kp6:15.2": "Virattacittāyatike bhavasmiṁ; ", "kp6:15.3": "Te khīṇabījā avirūḷhichandā, ", "kp6:15.4": "Nibbanti dhīrā yathāyaṁ padīpo; ", "kp6:15.5": "Idampi saṅghe ratanaṁ paṇītaṁ, ", "kp6:15.6": "Etena saccena suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:16.1": "Yānīdha bhūtāni samāgatāni, ", "kp6:16.2": "Bhummāni vā yāni va antalikkhe; ", "kp6:16.3": "Tathāgataṁ devamanussapūjitaṁ, ", "kp6:16.4": "Buddhaṁ namassāma suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:17.1": "Yānīdha bhūtāni samāgatāni, ", "kp6:17.2": "Bhummāni vā yāni va antalikkhe; ", "kp6:17.3": "Tathāgataṁ devamanussapūjitaṁ, ", "kp6:17.4": "Dhammaṁ namassāma suvatthi hotu. ", "kp6:18.1": "Yānīdha bhūtāni samāgatāni, ", "kp6:18.2": "Bhummāni vā yāni va antalikkhe; ", "kp6:18.3": "Tathāgataṁ devamanussapūjitaṁ, ", "kp6:18.4": "Saṅghaṁ namassāma suvatthi hotūti. ", "kp6:19.1": "Ratanasuttaṁ. "}, "reference_text": {"kp6:0.1": "", "kp6:0.2": "", "kp6:1.1": "ms18Kh_45, msdiv1, sya25.5", "kp6:1.2": "", "kp6:1.3": "", "kp6:1.4": "", "kp6:2.1": "csp1ed18.5, csp2ed18.5, ms18Kh_46, msdiv2", "kp6:2.2": "", "kp6:2.3": "", "kp6:2.4": "", "kp6:3.1": "ms18Kh_47, msdiv3, pts-vp-pli4", "kp6:3.2": "", "kp6:3.3": "", "kp6:3.4": "", "kp6:3.5": "", "kp6:4.1": "cck25.5, dr25.6, ms18Kh_48, msdiv4, vri47.6", "kp6:4.2": "", "kp6:4.3": "", "kp6:4.4": "", "kp6:4.5": "", "kp6:5.1": "mc0.6, ms18Kh_49, msdiv5, sya25.6", "kp6:5.2": "", "kp6:5.3": "", "kp6:5.4": "", "kp6:5.5": "", "kp6:6.1": "bj24.10, ms18Kh_50, msdiv6, ndp20.7", "kp6:6.2": "", "kp6:6.3": "", "kp6:6.4": "", "kp6:6.5": "", "kp6:6.6": "", "kp6:7.1": "csp1ed18.6, csp2ed18.6, ms18Kh_51, msdiv7", "kp6:7.2": "", "kp6:7.3": "", "kp6:7.4": "", "kp6:7.5": "", "kp6:7.6": "", "kp6:8.1": "cck25.6, dr25.7, mc0.7, ms18Kh_52, msdiv8, sya25.7", "kp6:8.2": "", "kp6:8.3": "", "kp6:8.4": "", "kp6:8.5": "", "kp6:8.6": "", "kp6:9.1": "ms18Kh_53, msdiv9", "kp6:9.2